  Delta
  \end{minipage} \\
  \midrule\noalign{}
  \endhead
  \bottomrule\noalign{}
  \endlastfoot
  Silicone rubber & \$53,500 & \textasciitilde\$60,000 & Floor same, more
  foam for partitions \\
  Titanium/Inconel frame & \$165,000 & \textasciitilde\$255,000 & +55\%
  weight \\
  Borosilicate glass & \$500,000 & \textasciitilde\$835,000 & +67\% wall
  area \\
  Solar panels & \$200,000 & \textasciitilde\$200,000 & Roof area
  unchanged \\
  Airlock(s) & \$100,000 & \textasciitilde\$200,000 & 2 units + hatch \\
  Battery system & – & \textasciitilde\$80,000 & New \\
  Water recycling system & – & \textasciitilde\$150,000 & New \\
  LED grow lights & – & \textasciitilde\$60,000 & New \\
