  \textbf{Sol 2 (Tuesday)} & Science & Laboratory experiments; geological
  sample analysis; Earth data downlink \\
  \textbf{Sol 3 (Wednesday)} & Engineering & Systems maintenance; filter
  changes; pressure checks; ISRU operations \\
  \textbf{Sol 4 (Thursday)} & EVA Day & Pair EVA (2 crew, 4 h); regolith
  collection; exterior inspection; sensor deployment \\
  \textbf{Sol 5 (Friday)} & Medical + Training & Full medical
  examinations; emergency drills; skills cross-training \\
  \textbf{Sol 6 (Saturday)} & Housekeeping & Deep cleaning; laundry; waste
