  \textbf{Weekly mandatory activities:} - 1 × EVA sortie (2 crew, minimum
  4 h) - 1 × emergency drill (fire, depressurisation, medical,
  communication loss — rotating) - 1 × crew meeting (open discussion of
  issues, morale check) - 1 × deep-clean of all communal areas - 1 × water
  quality analysis (microbial + chemical) - 1 × atmospheric composition
  verification (manual cross-check of sensors)
  
