  monthly & Publish seasonal agricultural performance reports \\
  \textbf{Water cycle} & Monitor daily: flow rates, quality parameters,
  recovery rate & Mass balance model: inputs, losses, recycling efficiency
  & Simulate failure modes (pump failure, membrane fouling) & Compare
  model predictions vs.~sensor data & Annual water cycle performance
  paper \\
  \textbf{Waste cycling} & Track compost maturation, nutrient content,
  microbial activity & Nutrient flow model: N, P, K balance across all
  waste streams & Simulate optimal C:N ratios, temperature profiles,
  retention times & Lab-test compost samples against model predictions &
  Publish waste-to-resource conversion efficiency data \\
  \textbf{Energy} & Log power generation, consumption, storage levels
  daily & Energy balance model incorporating seasonal solar variation &
  Simulate dust storm scenarios (2, 4, 8-week duration) & Compare actual
  power reserves vs.~model during real storms & Annual energy system
  performance report \\
  \textbf{Crew health} & Daily vitals, weekly mood surveys, monthly bloods
  & Crew health model: fitness = f(exercise, nutrition, sleep, stress) &
  Predict health trajectories under reduced exercise / poor sleep &
  Compare with actual medical data & Contribute to interplanetary medicine
  literature \\
  \textbf{Structural} & Monitor pressure, temperature gradients, material
  fatigue sensors & FEA model of structure under Martian conditions &
  Simulate extreme events (meteorite impact, dust storm loading) & Compare
  sensor data vs.~model predictions & Engineering performance reports \\
  \end{longtable}
  
