**Key insight:** ISRU capability ($400 K on Earth) can save tens of millions in future transport costs by producing replacement glass, rubber, and metals on Mars. The ISRU system pays for itself if it displaces even 2,000 kg of shipped materials.

***

#### 13. Comparison with Earth Analogues

