  & Warm \\
  07:00–07:45 & 45 min & Breakfast (communal) & Warm \\
  07:45–08:00 & 15 min & Daily briefing + task assignment & Temperate \\
  08:00–10:00 & 2 h & \textbf{Agricultural maintenance} — harvest,
  planting, pruning, nutrient checks & Cool \\
  10:00–10:15 & 15 min & Break & — \\
  10:15–12:15 & 2 h & \textbf{Science / Laboratory work} — experiments,
