  \textbf{Sol 3 (Wednesday)} & Engineering & Systems maintenance; filter
  changes; pressure checks; ISRU operations \\
  \textbf{Sol 4 (Thursday)} & EVA Day & Pair EVA (2 crew, 4 h); regolith
