  \paragraph{12.2 Transport Cost Impact}\label{transport-cost-impact}
  
  At SpaceX Starship target rate of \textasciitilde\$200/kg to LEO (with
  Mars transit multiplier \textasciitilde\$2,700/kg total):
  
  \begin{longtable}[]{@{}lll@{}}
