  \end{minipage} & \begin{minipage}[b]{\linewidth}\raggedright
  Mitigation
  \end{minipage} & \begin{minipage}[b]{\linewidth}\raggedright
  Residual Risk
  \end{minipage} \\
  \midrule\noalign{}
  \endhead
  \bottomrule\noalign{}
  \endlastfoot
  Crop failure (disease/pest) & Medium & Critical & Species diversity;
  sealed growing chambers; biological pest control; 6-month food reserve &
  Low \\
  Water system failure & Low & Critical & Dual-redundant pumps; 10 m³
  reservoir; manual purification capability & Low \\
  Solar storm (SPE) & Low & High & Storm shelter; 8-minute warning from
  Earth; autonomous shelter protocol & Low \\
